#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:130
msgid "Q: How do I restrict endpoints to specific user roles?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:131
msgid "A: Each endpoint has a \"User roles\" dropdown where you can select which roles can see it (e.g., Customer, Subscriber, Administrator). Leave it blank to show to all users. This is useful for:"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:133
msgid "• Showing wholesale pricing only to wholesale customers"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:134
msgid "• Displaying admin tools only to administrators"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:135
msgid "• Creating VIP-only sections for premium members"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:140
msgid "Q: Can I add custom content to an endpoint?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:141
msgid "A: Yes! The \"Endpoint content\" field accepts:"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:143
msgid "• HTML markup for custom layouts"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:144
msgid "• Shortcodes from other plugins"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:145
msgid "• Text with formatting"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:146
msgid "• Embedded forms or widgets"
msgstr ""

#: admin/partials/wcmp-faq.php:148
msgid "Example: [contact-form-7 id=\"123\"] to embed a contact form."
msgstr ""

